@startuml

[*] --> Unassigned : Start

Unassigned --> Assigned : ManagerAssigned, StaffAssigned
Assigned --> Approved : EverythingApprovedAndContractSigned
Approved --> Activated : EverythingApprovedAndContractSigned
Activated --> Running : AdvertsPrepared, AdvertsApprovedAndScheduled
Running --> Running : ExtensionOrAdjustmentRequested
Running --> Completed : AllAdvertsFinished
Completed --> Paid : FullAmountPaid
Completed --> Refunded : CorrectBalanceSettled

Paid --> [*] : Campaign Completed and Paid

Refunded --> [*] : Campaign Refunded

@enduml
